    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>How DSG Exterior Cleaning collects, uses, and protects your information</p>
</section>

<div class="policy-container">

    <div class="policy-intro">
        <p><strong>DSG Exterior Cleaning LLC</strong> is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard information when you visit dsgclean.com or contact us for services. By using our website or requesting a quote, you agree to the terms of this policy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly when you submit a quote request, call or text us at 845-208-9557, email us at info@dsgclean.com, interact with our Google Ads, or contact us through social platforms. This may include your name, email, phone number, property address, and service details. We also collect technical data through Google Analytics including IP address, browser type, and pages visited.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your information to prepare quotes, schedule appointments, send invoices, communicate about your service, request Google reviews after completion, and improve our website and marketing. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>3. Service Providers</h2>
        <p>We share your information only with providers who help us operate our business:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Jobber - scheduling, quoting, and invoicing</li>
            <li>QuickBooks - accounting and payroll</li>
            <li>Google - analytics, advertising, and business profile</li>
            <li>Ruby Receptionist - phone answering service</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Each provider may not use your information beyond providing services to DSG.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>4. Google Analytics and Advertising</h2>
        <p>We use Google Analytics (G-94B0E9VKL1) to understand how visitors use our website. You can opt out at tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout. We also run Google Search Ads and Local Services Ads. When you interact with our ads, Google may collect information per their Privacy Policy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
        <p>Our website uses cookies to improve your experience and enable Google Analytics. By using our website you consent to cookies. You can control them through your browser settings.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>Your quote and service data is stored securely within Jobber using industry-standard encryption. No internet transmission is 100% secure but we take all reasonable measures to protect your information.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>Client records are typically retained for a minimum of 3 years for business and tax purposes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information. You may opt out of marketing communications by replying STOP to any text or emailing info@dsgclean.com.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our website and services are not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. The Last Updated date below will reflect any changes. Continued use of our website after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>11. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>This Privacy Policy is governed by the laws of the State of New York. Disputes shall be resolved in the courts of Dutchess County, New York.</p>
    </div>

